   1:Source/render/decoders/xbm.c **** /*
   2:Source/render/decoders/xbm.c ****  * PlutoBrowser — xbm.c
   3:Source/render/decoders/xbm.c ****  * XBM decoder (see xbm.h). Parses "#define <name>_width N" / "_height N",
   4:Source/render/decoders/xbm.c ****  * then hex bytes until the closing brace. Bit (x,y) = byte[y*stride + x/8]
   5:Source/render/decoders/xbm.c ****  * bit (x%8) with LSB-first ordering (X11 hot bit layout). A set bit is black
   6:Source/render/decoders/xbm.c ****  * (XBM is a cursor mask: 1 = ink). Output via Bayer dither.
   7:Source/render/decoders/xbm.c ****  */
